1. IMPLEMENTATION INSTRUCTIONS

Implement all approved features and improvements in the existing MarketZed Android application.

This is an enhancement of the existing application, not a replacement.

NON-NEGOTIABLE REQUIREMENTS:

- Preserve existing working functionality and integrations.
- Inspect the existing codebase before implementation.
- Preserve existing Firestore schemas wherever possible.
- Do not introduce incompatible authentication or database systems.
- Maintain the existing MarketZed identity and design direction.
- Build an original, professional, accessible marketplace UI.
- Support both light and dark themes.
- Prioritize fast loading, efficient queries and smooth navigation.
